[{"title":"花下偶坐","author":"曾习经","text":"桃杏交花坐敛襟，闭门遣日自深深。\n偶参太始成良觌，肯枉佳辰事苦吟。\n一往用情终不悔，久幽勿嚏分平沉。\n所欣懒惰真天赋，十载嵇康锻树阴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43244,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南下洼钓鱼","author":"曾习经","text":"乐方难具陈，时复从儿嬉。\n及晡理钓竿，起行芦之漪。\n小雨不作难，好风来无倪。\n信手忽有得，一寸具鳞鬐。\n童稚竞欢哗，我亦微拈髭。\n意适无大小，手眼殊忘疲。\n一盂暂为盛，携归供盆池。\n家人闻得鱼，逼观色都怡。\n陋哉韩文公，即事多涕洟。\n作诗赠侯喜，较量铢与锱。\n横江遮紫鳞，亦复宁许奇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43245,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纳凉","author":"曾习经","text":"萝架疏林漏月明，藤轮小凭纳宵清。\n瓜葫磊砢论庭实，箫管中和辨乐声。\n露地及忘炎暑在，秋河先见夜云轻。\n一身自了从人说，历劫逃虚不近名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43246,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"牵牛花","author":"曾习经","text":"牵牛儿女花，轻茜他不知。\n朝曦初美妆，晨露微沾裾。\n迢迢灵匹期，盈盈盥漱馀。\n引蔓庭竹梢，乘风若淩虚。\n沉吟静女篇，怅望东邻姝。\n搔头珣期琪，耳后大秦珠。\n杂佩纷陆离，璎珞亲曼殊。\n嗟尔牵牛花，织女花则无。\n造化颠倒中，谁谓痴与俱。\n笑语天帝孙，诚堪持作夫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43247,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苦热","author":"曾习经","text":"春旱夏多雨，未得气候正。\n老夫向畏暑，一夏尚易竟。\n今夏雨又少，蒸郁如坐甑。\n殷雷牛鸣盎，烨电雉窜镜。\n稍阴倏开朗，桓旸更暴横。\n躁扰蟹将糖，局兽蹐陷阱。\n有如在逃难，无处苛宽政。\n临餐辄蹙额，尽吸始称庆。\n赒饿可澹虑，消渴疑要症。\n迟迟送日脚，兀兀瞻斗柄。\n平生圣之徒，朝眠费三请。\n晚亦耽白业，修慧不修定。\n炎凉外境界，分别识匪性。\n屈指晚旬日，迎秋著为令。\n少安且勿躁，道在天可胜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43248,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前年庭角种桃树谓山桃也花后青子累累儿童日撼树弹鸟雀尽今岁牵牛藤罥其梢时底馀十数熟甚美露坐摘尝因赋","author":"曾习经","text":"开花既可媚春日，摘实还堪饷老夫。\n思此亦不为分外，清晨抱瓮未曾无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43249,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉芙新婚为赠","author":"曾习经","text":"翡翠鸳鸯小小思，星河摇影露华滋。\n逢场忍俊今亲试，授简催妆只费词。\n最是挑鸾宜白袷，更教壁月照琼枝。\n春风桃李嫌粗俗，心许垂灯却扇时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43250,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补衣","author":"曾习经","text":"昨日补褾衽，今日补襜裾。\n□婢或窃笑，而我非真愚。\n念此吴绸衫，十载供曳揄。\n短裁适至肝，柔滑诚宜肤。\n衣故烦挪难，每浣辄一呼。\n捉襟可歌商，蒙袂或滥竽。\n去留稍吝情，于道微枝梧。\n处贫未为惯，私爱犹区区。\n床头百衲衣，旁亦置一壶。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43251,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盆兰盛开自初花至花尽在兰花香中过一月惜无佳章发此馨逸","author":"曾习经","text":"香草目以兰，南来携两盆。\n兰兰勤请客，客请亦殊殷。\n问客何为尔，中有忠爱痕。\n年来吾甚閒，种花事朝昏。\n左右高下花，惟花为独尊。\n去年茁三支，今岁花特繁。\n花花次第开，露白秋既分。\n所欣穷巷居，略无车马喧。\n坐我一月中，故故与温存。\n我诗无平淡，稍涉宛陵藩。\n报之实太啬，惭负徒云云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43252,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁旱山楂实小推盘累累如樱桃","author":"曾习经","text":"几时莲芡剥橐韬，梨栗新尝又一遭。\n谁与秋盘饤春实，山楂红小腻樱桃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43253,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉敕题元钱选右军观鹅图","author":"曾习经","text":"一世羲之惋慨多，临河誓墓意如何。\n画师只貌寻常事，爱说黄庭换白鹅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43254,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓠落剖两瓢一自携一挂杨漕田舍","author":"曾习经","text":"一瓢常自携，不乞邻舍浆。\n拟接河源水，试进昆仑觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43255,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题自画挂瓢图","author":"曾习经","text":"古人已厌一瓢喧，我今乃拾古所弃。\n不将佛法作人情，且与村居留境致。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43256,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题麦孺博潘若海诗词合卷","author":"曾习经","text":"少日长为文字饮，馀生同游海桑哀。\n新坟蒿草高三尺，惭负何时匹马来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43257,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为黄晦闻题广雅书院图","author":"曾习经","text":"当年南极通冠冕，转眼狐鸣篝火丛。\n马队只今非讲肄，荆榛寒雨又秋风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43258,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点校倚松老人诗集","author":"曾习经","text":"钞本倚松诗，讹脱如乱麻。\n多时存吾箧，每见辄惋嗟。\n雪窗有馀閒，奋笔事骚爬。\n稍披荆棘丛，寒条见嘉花。\n存神郁蓊间，叹息静无哗。\n谭谭江西派，宛宛见角牙。\n惜多知解词，金襕炫袈裟。\n开卷五七言，渊乎殊无涯。\n持比文字禅，一可当一年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43259,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题晁具茨集","author":"曾习经","text":"一代新诗百态工，少陵犹在后山功。\n中原文献推晁氏，得及陈门便不同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43260,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题康长素先生游存庐","author":"曾习经","text":"壮游十一国，存此好楼居。\n岳岳乾淳老，冥冥天地初。\n一身甘世殉，四海恐邻孤。\n不昧已灵事，还思种树庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43261,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绮儿画秋塘白鹭为题","author":"曾习经","text":"风动青芦三两枝，寒塘秋鹭影沦漪。\n江乡此景寻常有，高柳黄尘特见奇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43262,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观米虹月《千金一笑》新剧三首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"名父生儿自不凡，不随世味共咸酸。\n十年几斛江洲泪，又为才媛湿满衫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43263,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观米虹月《千金一笑》新剧三首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"凝碧池边泪共潸，笙楼忍再听哀弦。\n郁轮同是残科第，每阅沧桑一惘然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43264,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"观米虹月《千金一笑》新剧三首 其三","author":"曾习经","text":"惑尽阳城一冁然，点头顽石亦成颠。\n售文鬻字都无用，终倚闺媛卖曲钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43265,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪后偶书","author":"曾习经","text":"残雪栖庭树，今年春物迟。\n斜行临草贴，方竹薛筇枝。\n避世南垂谶，投囊闰岁诗。\n维摩散花地，谁道无立锥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43266,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题绮儿画二首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"枯木寒藤依绝谳，飞流直下千尺强。\n会须来此坐清昼，评量谷帘蟹眼汤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43267,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题绮儿画二首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"端居忽忽起乡心，满眼风生椰树林。\n尺幅应须论万里，牂柯南下更萧森。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43268,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为胡子贤题归初粤人诗画集","author":"曾习经","text":"偶从无字句间寻，几度迟回懒重吟。\n一代遗民昵官长，削圆方竹竟何心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43269,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丁三诗轴为胡子贤题","author":"曾习经","text":"日念元宾八九狂，飘零诗墨尚飞扬。\n旧情更有胡都讲，同对春风各黯伤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43270,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟温飞卿杨柳枝六首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"种得垂杨意亦消，临风尽日短长条。\n黄絁入道何年事，流恨仙人碧玉箫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43271,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟温飞卿杨柳枝六首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"并树绯桃花较迟，昏黄春月正相宜。\n桃根桃叶开风始，商略清歌到竹枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43272,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟温飞卿杨柳枝六首 其三","author":"曾习经","text":"旧栽百倍近南塘，攀折年深尔许长。\n寄与粉绵飞絮道，春寒犹著郁金堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43273,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟温飞卿杨柳枝六首 其四","author":"曾习经","text":"冶叶倡条那复论，寻常坊巷半朱门。\n灵和殿角东风哨，只有颦眉最感恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43274,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟温飞卿杨柳枝六首 其五","author":"曾习经","text":"金缕初干试解衣，断肠惟有晏家词。\n十年一觉承平梦，银烛西台赌柘枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43275,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟温飞卿杨柳枝六首 其六","author":"曾习经","text":"生死如山不动尘，更何言句谢天亲。\n无端强附金荃集，付与寻枝摘叶人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43276,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲子正月十六夜月蚀","author":"曾习经","text":"玉川愤慨宛陵平，治乱无缘共一声。\n怪事见多翻不怪，掩窗烧烛坐深更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43277,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"携绮儿森儿畿辅先哲祠看海棠","author":"曾习经","text":"北学堂前一树繁，入门先觉玩蜂喧。\n略空无隙分枝干，别有馀丛似子孙。\n并世与谁论甲子，持觞欲直进昆仑。\n文襄去久花今在，中有先朝雨露痕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43278,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏偶书","author":"曾习经","text":"眼看生物日趋功，天意何曾欲尔穷。\n已著单衣花事少，刺梅含蓄入薰风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43279,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"藤下诵普贤行愿品偶成","author":"曾习经","text":"万千缨珞宛垂肩，愿力无人嗣普贤。\n虚驾六牙驯白象，苍生摩顶待何年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43280,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同倦斋同年崇效寺看花即题倦斋集","author":"曾习经","text":"同是贞元花下人，香山老去更情亲。\n马行灯火看殊倦，蛮触兵争事更新。\n一日百年聊自遣，千诗万户拟非伦。\n耐閒笔劄浑成懒，偶向风前略欠伸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43281,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿祝云岑","author":"曾习经","text":"六十平头尔许奇，谈空说有诳童儿。\n清光只是丰湖月，想见云门跛阿师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43282,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋兰始花端侄游山回致山泉两瓶对花瀹碧螺春茶","author":"曾习经","text":"儿辈能添乐趣长，寻源特致谷帘汤。\n幽花始放逢佳茗，同领秋堂一味凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43283,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题梁文忠公诗札","author":"曾习经","text":"当时何止三千牍，此后真无六一贤。\n凄绝寒松门下士，至今辛苦守残篇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43284,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题石星巢先生诗札","author":"曾习经","text":"早年讲学似河汾，晚岁眈元异子云。\n莫怪临风齿牙落，乾淳一老已邱坟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43285,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艳秋新婚并画并蒂莲花并题","author":"曾习经","text":"孔翠鸳雏略费评，楼前红烛笑相迎。\n偶然拾得青羊句，并蒂莲花愿往生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43286,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画菊花枫叶小幅送唐天如入湖南","author":"曾习经","text":"学画衰年亦大难，宋元粉本半丛残。\n别情湛湛长江水，黄菊花开枫叶丹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43287,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赵龙云先生挽诗 先生同年赵尧生之兄，于尧生有恩，尧生自蜀讣告遂寄挽","author":"曾习经","text":"严事剩传君实美，铭幽待看颖滨文。\n时常但道桑麻长，五十初无被纩温。\n世乱有谁钦鸑鷟，社阑定复对鸡豚。\n贼尘满目西南道，那及新阡酹一尊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43288,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁次侯六十寿","author":"曾习经","text":"十年吾共师田水，并世谁同饱蕨芽。\n哀郢湘累称揽揆，椎秦博浪不为家。\n亦知儒术今无效，颇信劳生未有涯。\n子复生孙孙复子，移山辛苦缓羲车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43289,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寒夜校参同契","author":"曾习经","text":"稀微道妙此犹存，真火还须辨武文。\n为读参同眠较晚，地炉银铫水微温。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43290,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自题梅花","author":"曾习经","text":"花瓣钩完略点椒，孤根犹恐暗香飘。\n弯埼隔水深深见，只与幽人慰寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43291,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜闻窗外藤荚落地锵然有声作","author":"曾习经","text":"穷巷绝车辙，那复夜长娱。\n老眼久昏花，亦无必读书。\n耳根顿清净，游心天地初。\n藤荚霜风乾，锵然落阶除。\n静极疑动机，声希真欲无。\n聩丸严鼓停，投谶清漏徂。\n风箨有馀思，尔其倡和予。\n兀对短檠灯，乃复尽一壶。\n既以物付物，宁知吾为吾。\n凌晨拾坠子，哗然欢众雏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43292,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寒夜吟","author":"曾习经","text":"百虫声绝风怒号，重檐翳尽霜月高。\n渐老畏寒性爱月，得酒起披故缊袍。\n缊袍多年暖著体，中有高堂旧针指。\n儿寒犹馀慈母心，新阡远在荒山趾。\n念次涕下不能收，仰看星月相西流。\n半岭孙登似长啸，侧窗楚老但唲呕。\n子复生孙本常事，人生要为太早计。\n风树曾无停静时，严宵乘有汛澜泪。\n乌鹊巢寒啅坠枝，谁见当春乌哺儿。\n从今不敢看寒月，苦忆书灯年幼时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43293,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题张文襄师评傅子丹广雅课卷","author":"曾习经","text":"回首春风画戟枝，烧灯讨论柏梁诗。\n吾生顽薄诚无状，犹及官师合一时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43294,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题廖凤舒《新粤讴》四首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"涉想岂更此而忆，闻歌辄唤奈何声。\n时间自有真天籁，约略风诗见性情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43295,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题廖凤舒《新粤讴》四首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"十里轻烟覆大堤，行郎临发马嘶嘶。\n檀槽半咽馀音袅，弦月弯弯夜向低。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43296,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题廖凤舒《新粤讴》四首 其三","author":"曾习经","text":"晓风残月大江东，不是怜侬更恼公。\n曲子头衔原不恶，秋堂烛泪引宵红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43297,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题廖凤舒《新粤讴》四首 其四","author":"曾习经","text":"珠海珠江我所思，碧澜寸寸见秋漪。\n越吟正自怜庄舄，不薄巴人下里词。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43298,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙丑上巳江亭修稧分韵得同字","author":"曾习经","text":"生也无涯事不穷，世间还有永和风。\n他忧付与从今始，一笑相随亦愿同。\n自昔文章工感慨，适来轩骑任西东。\n百花待放芦先茁，憔悴芹芽浅水中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43299,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"梨花相倚海棠香，积李崇桃画夜光。\n漫诧岁赀营日富，一庭春物太昌昌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43300,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其二","author":"曾习经","text":"筋力生成不告疲，黄昏新有同牙儿。\n藤轮备准藤花下，倏见蜘蛛结网丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43301,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其三","author":"曾习经","text":"年年修竹报平安，置闰犹馀四月寒。\n莫怪姗姗称倾国，来迟偏是牡丹栏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43302,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其四","author":"曾习经","text":"自觉今春寡出游，一轩栏槛尽淹留。\n谁言卉木无情物，幽草绿阴清昼阑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43303,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其五","author":"曾习经","text":"面面纱窗白日迟，双双舞蝶淡黄衣。\n新阴欲满春藤秀，正是葡萄上格时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43304,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其六","author":"曾习经","text":"故人远道劝加餐，一饭真成讨论难。\n独有庾郎贫未惯，春蔬小摘尚盈盈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43305,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其七","author":"曾习经","text":"青李来禽日给藤，交亲囊寄岁相仍。\n宣南故事吾能说，略似花之寺里僧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43306,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓居春晚花卉蔬果盛敷荣欣然有作八首 其八","author":"曾习经","text":"卅年閒梦在京城，一颂桃花浪得名。\n肯惜斜阳裁短什，世间还是玉溪生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43307,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晚犹寒偶赋","author":"曾习经","text":"春物昌昌等例看，偶吟应不费心肝。\n他忧早自还天地，结念时犹在燠寒。\n一夜从谁徐讨论，千诗付与待褒弹。\n百年有尔张皇处，剩可凌晨理药栏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43308,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"陈子砺七十寿","author":"曾习经","text":"江水东流西上鱼，孤情一往果何如。\n十年以长惟兄事，万里相望念友须。\n田里征题馀杂兴，遗民著录早成书。\n愿从扶杖观元化，仰首星辰近帝车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43309,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭罗瘿公三首 其一","author":"曾习经","text":"瓠落名方起，浮萍迹成尘。\n廿年为客梦，一代过江人。\n下笔乌丝近，登歌白石亲。\n颇疑忧畏尽，竟与死生邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":43310,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]